# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal Engine generated directories
# ------------------------------------------------------------

**/Binaries/
**/DerivedDataCache/
**/Intermediate/
**/Saved/

# Plugin generated build data
**/Plugins/**/Binaries/
**/Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Unreal generated project / IDE files
# ------------------------------------------------------------

.vs/
**/.vs/

*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.vsconfig

*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

